{"seq":2,"slug":"log-analysis-techniques","title":"日志分析技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/management/engineering-craftsmanship/troubleshooting-rca/log-analysis-techniques","wordCount":1427,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"日志分析技术\">日志分析技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>日志是系统的黑匣子，其质量在正常时无人关注，却在故障时直接决定定位速度；因此日志应作为可观测性的一部分在编码时内建，而非事后补丁。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量决定速度</strong>：好日志 5 分钟定位，差日志可能数小时且需要重新部署复现。</li>\n<li><strong>结构化优先</strong>：用结构化（JSON 等）日志替代拼接字符串，让日志可被程序化查询与聚合。</li>\n<li><strong>级别纪律</strong>：级别表达的是&quot;需要谁来处理&quot;，误用级别（如把错误打成 info）会淹没信号。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文丰富</strong>：在关键路径上带齐请求 ID、用户与耗时等上下文，单条日志才有诊断价值。</li>\n<li><strong>可观测性三支柱</strong>：日志、指标、追踪各有分工，分布式追踪用于串联跨服务调用链。</li>\n<li><strong>聚合与检索</strong>：集中聚合与命令式检索（grep/jq）让海量日志可用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本文后续的结构化日志设计、级别策略、检索技巧、分布式追踪与最佳实践清单，都是这些概念的具体展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"日志的工程价值\">日志的工程价值</h2><p>日志是系统的&quot;黑匣子&quot;——当一切正常时无人在意，但当故障发生时，日志质量直接决定了问题定位的速度。好的日志体系能让你在 5 分钟内定位问题，差的日志体系可能让你花 5 小时都找不到头绪。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[故障告警] --&gt; B{日志质量?}&#10;    B --&gt;|好| C[5 分钟定位问题]&#10;    B --&gt;|差| D[数小时盲目排查]&#10;    C --&gt; E[快速修复]&#10;    D --&gt; F[临时加日志\\n重新部署\\n等待复现]&#10;    F --&gt; G[问题早已不在]\">graph TD\n    A[故障告警] --&gt; B{日志质量?}\n    B --&gt;|好| C[5 分钟定位问题]\n    B --&gt;|差| D[数小时盲目排查]\n    C --&gt; E[快速修复]\n    D --&gt; F[临时加日志\\n重新部署\\n等待复现]\n    F --&gt; G[问题早已不在]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"结构化日志\">结构化日志</h2><h3 id=\"非结构化-vs-结构化\">非结构化 vs 结构化</h3><p>传统的纯文本日志难以被程序解析和检索。结构化日志使用 JSON 格式，让日志成为可查询的数据。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>非结构化日志</th>\n<th>结构化日志</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>格式</td>\n<td><code>[2024-03-15 10:30:45] ERROR - Failed to process order 12345</code></td>\n<td><code>{&quot;timestamp&quot;:&quot;2024-03-15T10:30:45Z&quot;,&quot;level&quot;:&quot;error&quot;,&quot;msg&quot;:&quot;Failed to process order&quot;,&quot;orderId&quot;:&quot;12345&quot;}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索</td>\n<td>正则匹配，容易遗漏</td>\n<td>字段精确查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合</td>\n<td>几乎不可能</td>\n<td>按字段分组统计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>告警</td>\n<td>文本匹配，高误报</td>\n<td>基于字段的精确告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分析</td>\n<td>人工阅读</td>\n<td>机器自动分析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"日志结构设计\">日志结构设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StructuredLog {&#10;  timestamp: string;&#10;  level: &#39;debug&#39; | &#39;info&#39; | &#39;warn&#39; | &#39;error&#39; | &#39;fatal&#39;;&#10;  message: string;&#10;  service: string;&#10;  traceId?: string;&#10;  spanId?: string;&#10;  userId?: string;&#10;  requestId?: string;&#10;  duration?: number;&#10;  error?: {&#10;    name: string;&#10;    message: string;&#10;    stack: string;&#10;  };&#10;  context?: Record&lt;string, unknown&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StructuredLog</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'debug'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'info'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'warn'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'error'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'fatal'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  service</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  traceId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  spanId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  userId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requestId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  duration</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  error</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    message</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    stack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">unknown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"实现示例\">实现示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import pino from &#39;pino&#39;;&#10;&#10;const logger = pino({&#10;  level: process.env.LOG_LEVEL ?? &#39;info&#39;,&#10;  formatters: {&#10;    level: (label) =&gt; ({ level: label }),&#10;  },&#10;  timestamp: pino.stdTimeFunctions.isoTime,&#10;  base: {&#10;    service: &#39;order-service&#39;,&#10;    env: process.env.NODE_ENV,&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;const requestLogger = (req: Request) =&gt;&#10;  logger.child({&#10;    requestId: req.headers.get(&#39;x-request-id&#39;),&#10;    traceId: req.headers.get(&#39;x-trace-id&#39;),&#10;    method: req.method,&#10;    path: new URL(req.url).pathname,&#10;  });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pino </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'pino'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> logger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pino</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  level: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">LOG_LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ??</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'info'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  formatters: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    level</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">label</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({ level: label }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timestamp: pino.stdTimeFunctions.isoTime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  base: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    service: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'order-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    env: process.env.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> requestLogger</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">req</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">child</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    requestId: req.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-request-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    traceId: req.headers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'x-trace-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    method: req.method,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    path: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> URL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(req.url).pathname,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"日志级别策略\">日志级别策略</h2><h3 id=\"级别定义与使用场景\">级别定义与使用场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n<th>生产环境输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>fatal</code></td>\n<td>系统即将崩溃</td>\n<td>不可恢复的错误，进程即将退出</td>\n<td>✅ 始终</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>error</code></td>\n<td>操作失败</td>\n<td>请求失败、外部服务不可用</td>\n<td>✅ 始终</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>warn</code></td>\n<td>潜在问题</td>\n<td>重试成功、降级策略生效、配置不推荐</td>\n<td>✅ 始终</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>info</code></td>\n<td>业务里程碑</td>\n<td>请求开始/结束、订单状态变更、用户登录</td>\n<td>✅ 始终</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>debug</code></td>\n<td>开发调试</td>\n<td>变量值、函数参数、中间状态</td>\n<td>❌ 按需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>trace</code></td>\n<td>极细粒度</td>\n<td>循环每步、SQL 查询内容</td>\n<td>❌ 仅调试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"日志级别决策树\">日志级别决策树</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要记录日志] --&gt; B{是否影响功能?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是: 操作失败| C{可恢复?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[fatal/error]&#10;    C --&gt;|是: 重试成功| E[warn]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| F{是业务事件?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[info]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H{是否有助于调试?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[debug]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[不记录]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要记录日志] --&gt; B{是否影响功能?}\n    B --&gt;|是: 操作失败| C{可恢复?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[fatal/error]\n    C --&gt;|是: 重试成功| E[warn]\n    B --&gt;|否| F{是业务事件?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[info]\n    F --&gt;|否| H{是否有助于调试?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[debug]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[不记录]</pre><h3 id=\"避免常见错误\">避免常见错误</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"logger.error(&#39;发生错误&#39;);&#10;logger.error(&#39;用户登录失败&#39;, {&#10;  userId: &#39;user-123&#39;,&#10;  error: err.message,&#10;  ip: req.ip,&#10;  userAgent: req.headers[&#39;user-agent&#39;],&#10;});&#10;&#10;logger.info(`处理订单 ${orderId}`);&#10;logger.info(&#39;处理订单&#39;, { orderId, itemCount: order.items.length });&#10;&#10;logger.debug(`密码是 ${password}`);&#10;logger.debug(&#39;用户认证&#39;, { userId, method: &#39;password&#39; });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logger.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'发生错误'</span><span style=\"color:#24